Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 为心爱的游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.37,0:00:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)WDC。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)决赛大会！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)也就是说进入半决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)庆祝…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)干杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎呀～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢 谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 好厉害啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能一路赢到半决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那…那个 小鸟 别生气了嘛～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 还在生气吗～？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在罐头工厂那里 被游马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丢下不管的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我不好啦。一不小心就沉迷决斗了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么一不小心啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（回忆）菜鸟就别吵了。菜鸟就别吵了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）来来来，好吃的做好啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶……奶奶……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哦～太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）看起来好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多吃点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肚子饿扁了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开～吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以礼开始，以礼结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也应该如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，要“我开动了”。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.77,0:01:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）我开动了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊游马剩下的那些家伙可都是超强敌啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼、快斗，还有特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！不管是什么样的家伙放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是猫捉老鼠哦 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明全都是险胜而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}包在我身上啦 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)确实能留到现在的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}净是些不能大意的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆的纹章之力还有 No.卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的超强力新银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有鲨鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 CNo.卡是什么东西…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么他会持有 CNo.卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要拿下决斗嘉年华的冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有这套卡组跟着…！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有Dr.费卡到底又是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有！没有！没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组弄丢了～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的… 简直不敢相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然把重要的卡组弄丢了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:04:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也没办法啊。丢都丢了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那，真的在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们决斗者的卡组盒上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和D面板联动装有GPS功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据那个显示游马君的卡组盒…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里，心园！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好意思～有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请开开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，拜托了求求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 开一下门嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开门！ 叫你开门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开门！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打定主意不开了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就翻过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事怎么可能做得到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这点高度就当是30段的跳箱好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是不行啊。想偷偷溜进去什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的… 你真是个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边 有卡车一辆接一辆地进去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}载着奥波特的垃圾回收车{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灵光一闪啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}计中计啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要进这个垃圾箱里面吗～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)没错啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成垃圾 然后就这样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让奥波特回收的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进到心之大陆里面啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有这一手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 祝你武运昌隆啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂… 喂！ 那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 那么 赶紧的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 真的进去了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 没办法铁男 拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 难道我也要去？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为只有游马去的话我不放心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垃圾桶还剩一个。才不会让给小鸟喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？等一下，我又不是……垃圾桶里有什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是和游马在一起太狡猾了喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且就算小鸟在也派不上什么用场喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《叮～》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个～ 那不如
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪代替我去……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊 用猜拳来决定吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)猜拳 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是人类的爱情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 单纯是好胜心…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了 我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然 垃圾桶… 哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们几个 快点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)好～。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫！ 打扫！ 打扫！ 打扫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等… 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连垃圾都不如 连垃圾都不如。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是个堂堂正正的垃圾吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说了等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)你看 按我说的发展了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}计划很顺利。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到明天所有 No.者都是我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也付出了牺牲。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然遗憾 但也没办法呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 他们干得不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是我的儿子们。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙){\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：但是拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你能救救托隆… 救救父亲。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是你的话 一定能救出爸爸…))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《托隆…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}设下圈套陷害我伤害我妹妹的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是 你…！》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对 不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等你哦 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在哪 托隆！ 你在哪里!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样 你就是我的了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也许以为 在上次的决斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经克服了心之暗但说不定只是这样以为而已{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都在计划之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 好好地完成了他的工作呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 让我帮你扩展开来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你的心之暗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成更大更大的黑暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)那家伙是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～ 竟然把淑女当垃圾对待！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这样一来就能进去了！ 嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟 糟了… 要掉下去了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要掉下去了～ 救命…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 停… 停下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼… 得救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？这些全都是垃圾吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么心园底下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会有这么大的垃圾处理场？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《刚才那影像是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里到底发生过什么……》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这上面有遥人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遥人在！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个人都没有呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的要进去吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《遥人，遥人……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边有电梯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定能通到上面去……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 走起！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发现入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将在决斗中排除入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么办！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人家说要决斗那也只能上了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR幻象 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 有什么东西出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来了好多卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怪兽excess的卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤废品回收者！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这里的怪兽卡拿去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟跳上前面的3号面板！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我用两张等级3的超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 全满机雷全满雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！全满机雷全满雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击回收机！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤废品搜索者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又冒出来一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这里交给我 你先走。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管了快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是要去见春人君吗！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了 交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)喂 这边！ 废铁机器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的对手是我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 按下两张等级1！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两张1 1 1…… 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三张等级1叠放，超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 巨星之米拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 攻击搜索者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤废铁猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 等级2！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 闪光精灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 铁男 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底有几只啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里就是游马的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来哈鲁特还是跟那时候一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}意识还没有恢复的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听我说啊，哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，还在决斗嘉年华
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一路赢到现在呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把那家伙特隆狠狠打倒拿下冠军给你看的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到那时候，就算是你老哥凯特，我也不会手下留情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我那时候没有把你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给特隆他们的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈鲁特)游马 游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈鲁特)游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈尔特)游马 如果是你们的话 一定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会来的 我一直这么相信着。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！ 哈尔特你……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有一个请求。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请你们救救哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥他 非常疲惫。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 我却没有救哥哥的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 没办法离开这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求求你们 救救哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特的意识。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特的意识？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的哈尔特的意识 被封闭在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}内心的深处。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 能够将他真正的意识解放出来的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特或许能恢复原样。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特收集 No.卡这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎和这有什么关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 如果由我来收集 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特就治不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反过来 如果是凯特收集的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 到底我该怎么做才好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗的人是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由你来决定就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 如果我输了你就会消失啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在与你一同决斗的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从你身上学到了很多东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能与你并肩作战我觉得真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会遵从你选择的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论那是怎样的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔……你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要说那种话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该更闹一闹哭一哭才对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么“帮我恢复记忆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想就这样消失”啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话我也能彻底下定决心去战斗啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么 为什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）呵呵呵……哈哈哈……！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的名字是Dr.费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说来你就是快斗和阳斗的爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎，九十九一马的儿子……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且他还是NUMBERS的原版哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙……居然知道Astral的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你能看见我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.31,0:19:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么在收集NUMBERS！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}NUMBERS难道不是我的记忆吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。我和巴利安世界做了交易。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，那是与Astral世界并列的另一个异世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我通过毁灭Astral世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能将最强的力量收入囊中。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为这个世界的支配者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就为了这种事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才让凯特去猎杀NUMBERS的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就因为这个，凯特和哈鲁特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受了多大的苦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们俩都是你的又不是小孩子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是些微不足道的牺牲罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了获得最强的力量牺牲是必不可少的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗也好，隼人也好，还有九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的父亲，一马也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人总是要不断舍弃些什么才能活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是认真的吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原始。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明天的决赛大会我很期待哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可、可恶……好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛……真是的～又把人家当垃圾对待～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]心跳狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节终于到半决赛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]究竟谁会成为WDC初代冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢得这份荣冠{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的决斗者究竟是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，现在公布对战组合！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆 VS 凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 VS 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔……我一定会夺冠{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.43,0:22:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 把一切亲手解决掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.45,0:22:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超兴奋的！ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仔细想想 全是男的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想要兄弟啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果 其20。明里是女的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.69,0:24:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在才发现吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.59,0:24:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了……。

